&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Orcrist is building a next generation data intelligence platform using cutting-edge technologies. We&#39;re handling petabyte-scale data with sub-second queries. Our product is a Kubernetes‑based platform delivered as B2B SaaS or as a self‑hosted on‑prem solution, including air‑gapped deployments. We enable customers across defense, law enforcement, and enterprise to turn mission-critical data into actionable intelligence.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;As Data Protection &amp;amp; Quality Management Officer at Orcrist Technologies, you own our data protection framework and build and operate our ISO 9001 quality management system. You act as our appointed Data Protection Officer under GDPR and lead the development, maintenance, and continuous improvement of our QMS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Both are independent staff functions reporting directly to the C-Level Management. You advise, monitor, audit, and document; the business remains responsible for operational decisions and implementation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We build AI platforms for customers in the defence and government sector. Data protection and quality management are essential to our business and customer trust. As the company grows, you will build these structures hands-on, working closely with engineering, product, people, IT, and our Information Security Officer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain our data protection management system, including policies, processes, and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as our appointed DPO under Art. 37–39 GDPR and § 38 BDSG, advising management and teams on GDPR, BDSG, and TDDDG requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor compliance, including records of processing activities, processor agreements, TOMs, data protection impact assessments, and data subject requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on privacy by design, international data transfers, retention, and personal data breaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain our ISO 9001 QMS, including process documentation, quality objectives, risk-based thinking, and continual improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the internal audit programme, track nonconformities and corrective actions, and coordinate certification and surveillance audits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare the annual management review and report on data protection risks, audit findings, and improvement priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Train teams on data protection and quality management requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the ISB to align overlapping requirements while maintaining clear responsibilities and independence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel occasionally to our offices in Berlin, Dresden, and Hamburg, as well as to other workshop locations across Germany, to facilitate workshops, training sessions, and audits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On-site presence is expected to be more frequent during the initial implementation phase and primarily driven by audits and specific business needs thereafter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certified DPO training (GDD, TÜV, DEKRA, or equivalent) and at least 3 years of hands-on GDPR experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 2 years of practical ISO 9001 experience and an internal auditor qualification based on ISO 19011.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and maintaining data protection management systems and QMS documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The independence to challenge management, the judgement to prioritise risks, and a pragmatic approach to implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on mindset and confidence working with technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel occasionally within Germany and work in a hybrid setup, combining remote work with on-site activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;German and English at C1 level or above.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a software, SaaS, or AI company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with ISO/IEC 27001.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AQAP-Standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CIPP/E or comparable certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading a first ISO 9001 certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with GRC platforms or document control systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote-first, Germany-wide:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Work from wherever you do your best work, with regular team gatherings in Berlin and other off-site locations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibility by default: &lt;/strong&gt;Flexible working hours help you make work fit your life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your setup, your way: &lt;/strong&gt;Get a personal home-office equipment budget to create a workspace that works for you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;30 days of vacation:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Take the time you need to recharge and come back with fresh energy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keep growing: &lt;/strong&gt;We invest in your personal and professional development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Get rewarded for impact: &lt;/strong&gt;Performance bonuses are tied to agreed objectives and key results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A warm welcome: &lt;/strong&gt;Every new team member gets a welcome goodie bag.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Good people, good times: &lt;/strong&gt;From summer and Christmas parties to regular team gatherings, we make time to celebrate together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A mission that matters: &lt;/strong&gt;Work on challenges with tangible impact on public safety and national security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is leading a new era in cloud infrastructure for the global AI economy. We are building a full-stack AI cloud platform that supports developers and enterprises from data and model training through to production deployment, without the cost and complexity of building large in-house AI/ML infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built by engineers, for engineers. From large-scale GPU orchestration to inference optimization, we own the hard problems across compute, storage, networking and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on Nasdaq (NBIS) and headquartered in Amsterdam, we have a global footprint with R&amp;amp;D hubs across Europe, the UK, North America and Israel. Our team of 1,500+ includes hundreds of engineers with deep expertise across hardware, software and AI R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;In a rapidly evolving world, trust in AI depends on agents being grounded in fresh, verified real-world data. Search is the foundation that makes this possible.&lt;br&gt;We’re looking for an experienced Data Analyst who has built evaluation systems for complex technology products and is excited to take end-to-end ownership of quality in search built for AI agents.&lt;br&gt;This role combines hands-on engineering, analytical judgment, and mathematical rigor, with the scope and influence to shape both technical decisions and product direction. We move at a startup pace, with plenty of open questions and difficult problems to solve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;In this position, you will:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Own the quality measurement and improvement cycle end-to-end: identify user needs, define success, build evaluations, diagnose failures, and work with engineers and product managers to improve outcomes..&lt;br&gt;• Design, build, and evolve evaluation systems, including datasets, benchmarks, metrics, and automated pipelines that support development and launch decisions..&lt;br&gt;• Evaluate response quality across multiple dimensions, including relevance, completeness, freshness, factual accuracy, and usefulness to downstream agents..&lt;br&gt;• Investigate quality regressions and metric anomalies, uncover root causes, and identify the improvements with the greatest potential impact..&lt;br&gt;• Help prioritize the product and engineering roadmap, making quality trade-offs explicit and assessing whether changes deliver meaningful improvements for users..&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;We expect you to have:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;• Substantial hands-on experience designing and building evaluation or quality measurement systems for complex technology products, such as search, AI agents, voice technologies, autonomous driving, recommendation systems, advertising, or other similar complex systems..&lt;br&gt;• A track record of owning ambiguous problems from initial framing through implementation, diagnosis, and measurable product improvement..&lt;br&gt;• Strong Python skills and an engineering mindset: you can turn analytical ideas into reliable, maintainable pipelines and tools..&lt;br&gt;• A solid foundation in mathematical statistics and practical experience with experimental design, sampling, uncertainty, and measurement bias..&lt;br&gt;• Strong analytical judgment: you understand what a metric captures, what it misses, and whether an observed improvement matters to users..&lt;br&gt;• The ability to reason across user needs, product behavior, and technical systems, and to translate that understanding into actionable evaluations..&lt;br&gt;• Strong communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to influence technical and product decisions..&lt;br&gt;• The independence to make progress in a fast-moving environment where requirements, methods, and definitions of success are still evolving.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility and ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and innovative culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work on impactful AI projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International environment and talented teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s it like to work at Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fast moving&amp;nbsp;- Bold thinking&amp;nbsp;- Constant growth&amp;nbsp;- Meaningful impact&amp;nbsp;- Trust and real ownership&amp;nbsp;- Opportunity to shape the future of AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is an equal opportunity employer. We are committed to fostering an inclusive and diverse workplace and to providing equal employment opportunities in all aspects of employment. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, ancestry, age, disability, genetic information, marital status, veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants must be authorized to work in the country in which they apply and will be required to provide proof of employment eligibility as a condition of hire.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need accommodations during the application process, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Pallet &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pallet is building AI Agents to transform the physical economy, a $12 trillion global TAM. We’ve raised $50M from top investors, including General Catalyst, Bessemer Venture Partners, and Bain Capital Ventures.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to increase the efficiency of the global supply chain by automating the manual workflows that slow supply chain teams down. Our flagship platform provides end-to-end visibility, and control.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As companies across the physical economy look to drive efficiency, many are turning to Pallet to lead the way. With deep supply chain expertise and cutting-edge AI capabilities, we’re positioned to build the next $10B company powering the physical economy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us and work alongside leaders from Google, DoorDash, YC, and more to shape the future of supply chain technology.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote from Switzerland&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You could be an Enterprise Account Executive anywhere. Why us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join a well-funded, high-growth startup on a clear path to $100M ARR.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sell a category-defining AI Agents platform with massive surface area across logistics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build Pallet’s presence across Europe as one of the first commercial hires on the ground.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with founders and senior leadership to define our international go-to-market strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help transform one of the world’s largest industries while building toward a $10B+ outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring our first Founding Enterprise Account Executives in EMEA to build Pallet’s commercial presence across Europe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll own net-new enterprise acquisition across the region, build relationships with the largest logistics providers in Europe, and help establish the playbook for our international expansion. This is a highly consultative enterprise sales role focused on educating customers on an entirely new category of AI-powered workflow automation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll partner closely with Sales, Product, Engineering, Solutions, and Customer Success to drive a solution-selling motion centered around workflow discovery, AI use case identification, structured pilots, and measurable ROI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will be remote from Switzerland.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you will make an impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full enterprise sales cycle across EMEA, from outbound prospecting through contract signature.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a 3x-4x qualified pipeline through disciplined outbound execution while self-sourcing at least 30% of opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop relationships with executive stakeholders across Europe’s largest logistics providers, including COO, CIO, VP Operations, VP Supply Chain, and VP Technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead consultative discovery sessions that map operational workflows to Pallet’s AI agent capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scope and lead structured pilots that demonstrate measurable operational ROI and convert into enterprise deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build executive business cases that align operational improvements with financial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document repeatable customer use cases and market feedback to shape Pallet’s product roadmap and international GTM strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help establish Pallet as the leading AI platform for enterprise logistics across Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of enterprise B2B SaaS or enterprise logistics sales experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business-fluent German: you can run discovery, negotiate and present to executives in German.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of consistently closing six- and seven-figure enterprise software agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong consultative selling and value-based sales methodology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating complex buying committees and long enterprise sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive presence with senior operators and technology leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable selling technical, workflow-heavy software products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to quickly understand complex logistics operations and translate them into compelling AI automation opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent outbound prospecting and territory-building discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel extensively across Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience selling into logistics, supply chain, transportation, or warehouse operations is strongly preferred but not required. Candidates without logistics experience should demonstrate an ability to quickly learn operational workflows and become trusted advisors to customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working model&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working hours are generally &lt;strong&gt;9:00am-6:00pm London time&lt;/strong&gt;, providing full coverage of the European business day while maintaining regular collaboration with our San Francisco headquarters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll typically spend:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mornings and early afternoons working directly with European customers and prospects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Late afternoons collaborating with our US-based Sales, Product, and Engineering teams during our daily overlap window.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Approximately 65% of your time traveling across Europe for customer meetings, executive workshops, pilots, and industry events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll report directly to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;VP of Global Revenue&lt;/strong&gt;, for territory strategy, customer relationships, and international expansion and will participate in weekly pipeline reviews, forecasting, and sales process alignment with the US team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interview Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Chat with Christy - Business Recruiter - 30 mins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deal Review - 30 mins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discovery Mock Interview - 45-60 mins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Final Interview - ~2.5 hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brief Background Check and Reference Check&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We move fast, and we’ll keep you informed at every stage of the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The estimated compensation range for this role is&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;280-340k CHF&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;OTE&lt;/strong&gt;, 50/50 split, depending on experience and skill set.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our compensation follows a standard 50/50 enterprise sales structure consisting of base salary and target commission. High performers are eligible for uncapped commission accelerators above quota.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to cash compensation, we offer competitive equity, benefits, and significant growth opportunities as one of our earliest international commercial hires.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Final compensation will be determined based on experience, qualifications, and demonstrated enterprise sales performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We invest in our people the same way we invest in our product: seriously.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🩺 Health, Vision, and Dental benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏝️ Take-what-you-need Paid Vacation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;➕ Life Insurance and Accidental Insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;❤️‍🩹 Short-Term Disability Coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💸 Generous salary and equity for all staff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🪜 401k option; helping you save for the future&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🧑‍🧑‍🧒‍🧒 Paid parental leave to support growing families&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📚 Yearly learning and development stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚌 Commuter benefits for Bay Area and New York employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚘 Uber ride stipend if you ever have to work late in the office&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏡 Remote office home stipend to get you comfy in your space for remote employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;📸 Free professional headshot&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🍔 Daily catered lunches and dinners provided in office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💪 Complimentary On-Site Gym: Our SF office has a fully equipped gym&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;✈️ Onboarding trip to one of our offices if you work remotely&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🥤 Monthly happy hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🎉 Annual Company Offsites; our last one was in Palm Springs CA 🌴&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workplace Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an in-person company. Our offices in San Francisco, New York City and London are where ideas get built, decisions get made, and the team gets stronger. We have invested in making them genuinely great places to spend your day, with catered lunches, monthly happy hours, and people who care about the work and each other.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Most of our team works in office five days a week. For select roles, we hire remotely across the U.S. Remote employees come to one of our offices for their first week to onboard and meet the team, and we cover the full trip.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every role is different. Travel expectations are always shared upfront in the job description and confirmed in your first call with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pallet is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We make all employment decisions based solely on merit. We provide equal employment opportunities to all applicants and employees without discrimination on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, disability status, or any other applicable legally protected characteristic. We prohibit any form of discrimination or harassment. This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment, including hiring.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please review Pallet’s Candidate Privacy Notice &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pallet.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
