&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;12,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Événements / CI-CD :&lt;/strong&gt; Kafka, GitHub Actions&lt;/p&gt;
